🌐 OSI vs TCP/IP

OSI (7 Layers):

 Application → Presentation → Session → Transport → Network → Data Link → Physical

TCP/IP (4 Layers):

 Application → Transport → Internet → Link

Understand where IP, TCP, UDP, DNS, HTTP, HTTPS fits in networking stack

✔️ Performed network diagnostics using Linux commands such as ping, traceroute, ss -tulnp, netstat, nslookup & curl.

